{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/817122-dtf-as-changeling-court","id":817122,"title":"DtF as Changeling Court","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-26T13:45:55-08:00","id":817122,"title":"DtF as Changeling Court","content":"Has anyone felt like the ministry system from Demon the Fallen feels like it could fit as a Group of Courts? Imagine the Lores being akin to Contracts, and the Houses maybe as Entitlements. Not sure what the explanation behind it would be, though. Maybe it's like: by acting as demons, and harvesting sinful glamour, the Court lays claim to said vices, rendering mundies incapable of nourishing the True Evils of Arcadia when they come a hunting?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>nWoD Warhammer Fantasy RPG,<br /> WoD Wraith: The Oblivion<br /> and Infernum-style Demon: The Descent, Shadows of Abaddon --&gt; <a href=\"http://madnessforums.com/forums/index.php/topic,26.0.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://madnessforums.com/forums/inde...opic,26.0.html</a><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/974-mrparaduo","name":"MrParaduo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar974_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"967"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T13:02:41-08:00","id":817881,"title":"","content":"I don't know anything about Demon: The Fallen, but I can certainly imagine a freehold involving the seven deadly sins as their court emotions.<br /> <br /> I've recently played a game called Ossuary that puts